{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029094650760-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029100516\"/><p>餐廳冒出大量濃煙。</p><p>佐敦發生火警。今晨(29日)9時29分，彌敦道192-194號一間餐廳油煙槽冒出大量濃煙，驚動多人報案。消防員接報到場撲救，同時搜救隊到場協助救援。餐廳職員及食客自行疏散。據悉，港鐵佐敦站Ｄ出口需要封閉。據網上圖片所見，餐廳面向柯士甸道的油煙槽噴出濃煙，連彌敦道被煙霧罩蓋，途人均掩着口鼻逃避。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:22:13.330201+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:46:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:18:37.925406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:18:37.925406+00:00","content_hash":"c7965efbe2da8e92d1c79f02ec43571e00a341c25c5873aca09ddfe0a18e5b98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}